ment_ID":"MCTM-004476","Abbreviation_in_the_article":"Ru3","Cell_line":"MDA-MB-231","Time(h)":48,"IC50_Dark(M*10^-6)":5.46,"IC50_Dark_value":5.46,"Method":"MTT","DOI":"10.1093/mtomcs/mfac072","Year":2022,"Counterion":"[Cl-]","Type":"IC50","comparison":{"compound_id":"OBMD011700","measurement_id":"MCTM-004476","value":">50","numeric":50}},{"Measurement_ID":"MCTM-004477","Abbreviation_in_the_article":"Ru3","Cell_line":"MCF-7","Time(h)":48,"IC50_Dark(M*10^-6)":14.63,"IC50_Dark_value":14.63,"Method":"MTT","DOI":"10.1093/mtomcs/mfac072","Year":2022,"Counterion":"[Cl-]","Type":"IC50","comparison":{"compound_id":"OBMD011700","measurement_id":"MCTM-004477","value":"21.51","numeric":21.51}}],"logp":[{"abbreviation_in_the_article":"Ru3","value":1.4915,"value_relation":"=","type_authors":"logP","method":"shake-flask","aqueous_phase":"water","doi":"10.1093/mtomcs/mfac072","year":2022,"counterion":"[Cl-]","record_id":"MLDB-001421","detection":"ICP-MS","method_description":"The log P values of complexes Ru1, Ru2 and Ru 3 were measured using the shake-flask method. The shake-flask method uses the lipophilicity of n-octanol to model the lipid bilayer of a cell membrane. A sample is dissolved in a mixture of n-octanol and water (equal volume), and allowed to shake overnight to allow partitioning. After centrifuging the sample at 5000 rpm for 10 min, the aqueous layer was carefully separated from the octanol layer for ruthenium analysis. The Ru concentration in the aqueous phase was determined by ICP-MS and used to calculate the [Ru]o/[Ru]w ratio."}]}